# ===========================================================================
# agent-linux（AirymaxOS）管理仓 .gitignore
# 策略：非必要不追踪。各叶子仓自行维护 .gitignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 默认忽略所有
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 管理仓必要文件（白名单）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!.gitmodules
!.github/
!.github/**
!CODEOWNERS
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!LICENSE
!MAINTAINERS
!Makefile
!NOTICE
!README.md
!README_zh.md
!SECURITY.md
!.editorconfig
!.clang-format
!.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!ssot-registry.yaml
!tools/
!tools/**
!build/
!build/**
!sdk/
!sdk/**
!oci/
!oci/**
# 仓库级 CI 门禁（ci/ci.sh 分发 + ci/gates/ 实现 + workflow 薄化校验）
!ci/
!ci/**
# Python 运行残渣必须保持未跟踪：白名单放开了 ci/ 与 tools/，缺少显式
# 忽略项时 __pycache__ 与 .pytest_cache 会被整目录纳入跟踪面。
tools/__pycache__/
tools/**/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/*.pyc
